{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Get Ready for Chaotic &quot;Parking&quot; Fun with Your Friends!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your only goal as a duo is... to park the car in the designated spot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But watch out\u2014this parking is anything but ordinary...</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Crash Once and Boom!</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One collision spells instant game over! Stay sharp and brave that heart-pounding tension!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/image.png?t=1744004721\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Limited Time Outside the Car!</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can only stay out of the car for so long. Work together, split tasks, and survive each challenge as a team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/image.png2.png?t=1744004721\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3623330?t=1744004721","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3623330?t=1744004721","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/33df4e2bd245aec06d1c65ec45f33c78e9732d4a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744004721","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/33df4e2bd245aec06d1c65ec45f33c78e9732d4a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744004721","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descri